      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Dusk settles over Willowford as you stand among the residents gathered by the old footbridge. The bridge is close enough to reach, its lantern hook hanging empty above the dark water. A faded ribbon is knotted around the hook, and a wavering blue glimmer moves across the river’s surface.\n\nElin, the lamplighter, watches the search with a tense expression. Around you, the residents’ attention gathers on the bridge and the water beneath it; the empty hook, the ribbon, and the shifting glimmer are all in view.\n\nYou can approach Elin, take a closer look at the hook and ribbon, or watch the blue light move across the river. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 461,
      "citations": [
