    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Elin glances from the empty hook to the wavering blue reflection. “The lantern was taken to guide the missing child,” she says, her voice tight with worry. “Follow that blue light downstream toward the old ferry shelter. That’s the way to find them.”\n\nThe ribbon remains knotted around the swaying hook, and the reflection shifts across the dark water. Elin stays by the gathered residents as the trail leads downstream. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 464,
