    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You look closely at the ribbon: it is faded, old, and carefully retied around the swaying hook. The blue glimmer shifts over the water, traveling downstream from the bridge toward the old ferry shelter.\n\nElin follows your gaze. “You can follow it along the bank,” she says. “You needn’t enter the water.” The gathered residents remain by the bridge as dusk settles over Willowford. What do you do?",
