      "content": "Following the blue glimmer brings you to the old ferry shelter, its boards silvered by mist. A lantern casts a steady glow through the open doorway, and a small child waits inside. Beside the landing, ripples catch the light in a wavering blue pattern.\n\nYou can approach the doorway or look more closely at the water beside the landing. What do you do?",
